{"synopsis":"Aku tidak dilahirkan kembali dengan bakat ataupun kemampuan tetapi setidaknya pengetahuanku dari bumi memungkinkanku untuk tetap selangkah lebih maju di dunia lain ini\nSihir ada di sini dan kemajuan baru dengan cepat dibuat dalam sains sementara perkembangan sihir tersendat karena tradisi Menggunakan pengetahuan dari kehidupanku sebelumnya dan tidak terikat oleh pemikiran ortodok aku dapat melakukan halhal yang bahkan tidak dapat dibayangkan oleh penyihir lain\nNamun secara tidak sengaja menjadi profesor yang menyamar untuk perkumpulan rahasia misterius di akademi Sren yang terkenal tidak pernah ada dalam daftar tugasku.","alternative_title":"I Got a Fake Job at the  Academy, 아카데미에 위장취업당했다","author":"Sayren, WAG","artist":"WAG","chapters":[{"number":"168","chapter":"168","slug":"269cf626-fd63-4b78-bfab-df5f9ad288dd","date":"2026-05-10","images":[]},{"number":"167","chapter":"167","slug":"bf20e32a-bfe9-4b7e-b138-23b5b026b847","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"number":"166","chapter":"166","slug":"3c52749b-fefd-4cf8-9c53-8b8d0696d22a","date":"2026-05-02","images":[]},{"number":"165","chapter":"165","slug":"51e0d8d6-e779-4f14-9105-35fbcaca09d9","date":"2026-04-15","images":[]},{"number":"164","chapter":"164","slug":"1b51f0c5-64d6-43e4-ad79-50da14685f18","date":"2026-04-13","images":[]},{"number":"163","chapter":"163","slug":"29eec605-a6e0-442f-9686-7907b025a0cc","date":"2026-04-01","images":[]},{"number":"162","chapter":"162","slug":"84982eea-7b3f-4985-b5f8-222940c619ba","date":"2026-04-01","images":[]},{"number":"161","chapter":"161","slug":"4e3cad19-e382-422b-9664-f3f977d5fb1c","date":"2026-04-01","images":[]},{"number":"160","chapter":"160","slug":"d28f985e-7e0e-4a36-873c-35d0793a8eca","date":"2026-03-07","images":[]},{"number":"159","chapter":"159","slug":"a05ac77d-06e2-45da-b1ef-5d5c89b6235f","date":"2026-02-28","images":[]},{"number":"158","chapter":"158","slug":"e2c725e6-c953-4312-ab7e-d5a21fc9ed15","date":"2026-02-27","images":[]},{"number":"157"